Considering that the watchmen are in fact human, nothing bad will happen 
from sacrificing them. However, you will take a BIG alignment hit from 
killing the watchmen. According to the myths and facts spoiler, the 
penalty for killing a monster that is always created peaceful (like the 
watchmen) carries a penalty of -15. I tested this and it seems to apply 
even to chaotics. So unless you are sure that your alignment is in the 
hundreds, I would advise against it.


